      "widgets_values": [
        "## Advanced Auto-Aspect Pipeline — FP8 A/B Test\n\n### What changed\n- The first frame is resized **without changing its aspect ratio**.\n- Target area is **0.98 MP**, aligned to a **32-pixel multiple**.\n- `GetImageSize` drives H3 width and height automatically.\n- The scaled geometry anchor is shown in `PreviewImage` before generation.\n- Duration remains 6 seconds → **158 aligned frames** at 24 fps.\n- Seed remains fixed for controlled comparisons.\n\n### Why it matters\nThe H3 first-frame path stretches the image to the requested canvas. Matching the H3 canvas to the already-scaled input prevents horizontal or vertical deformation and avoids manually switching between 16:9 and 9:16.\n\n### Production procedure\n1. Inspect the preprocessing preview.\n2. Generate at least four seeds at the same settings.\n3. Upscale only the selected take with SeedVR2.\n4. Do frame interpolation only when the delivery format truly requires it.\n\n### Model\n`minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_fp8_scaled.safetensors`\n"
